# Finalization and submission

Before final training freeze:
- feature definitions,
- hyperparameters,
- target-specific quantiles,
- calibration parameters,
- ensemble weights.

Retrain using all permitted training data.

The final submission must contain exactly:

```text
file
Cycles_to_HPT_SV
Cycles_to_HPC_SV
Cycles_to_WW
```

Validate:
- exact row count,
- exact row order,
- exact column names,
- no NaNs,
- no infinities,
- no duplicate identifiers,
- no impossible negative cycle predictions.

Save enough metadata to reproduce predictions deterministically:
- random seed,
- package versions,
- feature list,
- fold definitions,
- model parameters,
- calibration,
- ensemble weights.
